Prove that:
1) $\log _{bn} (an) = \frac{\log _{b} a + \log _{b} n}{1 + \log _{b} n}$;
2) $\log _{ba^{n}} (a^{n+1}) = \frac{(n+1) \log _{b} a}{1 + n \log _{b} a}$;
3) $\log _{b^{n+1}} (ab^{n}) = \frac{\log _{b} a + n}{1 + n}$;
4) $\log _{b^{n}} (a^{n}) = \log _{b} a$.

